{"chars": "It didn't split or break. One of the long twisting ridges of bark simply stepped forward and became a shoulder. Another became an arm. And slowly, a face settled out of the furrowed wood: old beyond counting, grooved and gentle, with eyes the deep, quiet green of a forest at dusk. Its hair was a curtain of feathery cedar branches. Moss grew on its shoulders, along with a few tiny mushrooms and one curious little brown wren, who didn't seem bothered in the least.", "start": [0.225, 0.225, 0.35, 0.35, 0.35, 0.35, 0.35, 0.35, 0.35, 0.637, 0.637, 0.637, 0.637, 0.637, 0.637, 1.038, 1.038, 1.038, 1.212, 1.212, 1.212, 1.212, 1.212, 1.212, 1.925, 2.025, 2.025, 2.025, 2.025, 2.163, 2.163, 2.163, 2.237, 2.237, 2.237, 2.237, 2.35, 2.35, 2.35, 2.35, 2.35, 2.688, 2.688, 2.688, 2.688, 2.688, 2.688, 2.688, 2.688, 2.688, 3.15, 3.15, 3.15, 3.15, 3.15, 3.15, 3.15, 3.438, 3.438, 3.438, 3.55, 3.55, 3.55, 3.55, 3.55, 3.975, 3.975, 3.975, 3.975, 3.975, 3.975, 3.975, 4.325, 4.325, 4.325, 4.325, 4.325, 4.325, 4.325, 4.325, 4.688, 4.688, 4.688, 4.688, 4.688, 4.688, 4.688, 4.688, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.213, 5.213, 5.213, 5.213, 5.213, 5.213, 5.213, 5.513, 5.513, 5.612, 5.612, 5.612, 5.612, 5.612, 5.612, 5.612, 5.612, 5.612, 6.375, 6.513, 6.513, 6.513, 6.513, 6.513, 6.513, 6.513, 6.513, 6.875, 6.875, 6.875, 6.875, 6.875, 6.875, 6.875, 7.213, 7.213, 7.213, 7.338, 7.338, 7.338, 7.338, 8.025, 8.125, 8.125, 8.125, 8.125, 8.287, 8.287, 8.287, 8.287, 8.287, 8.287, 8.287, 8.875, 8.975, 8.975, 9.088, 9.088, 9.088, 9.088, 9.088, 9.438, 9.438, 9.438, 9.438, 9.438, 9.438, 9.438, 9.438, 9.825, 9.825, 9.825, 9.825, 9.963, 9.963, 9.963, 10.037, 10.037, 10.037, 10.037, 10.162, 10.162, 10.162, 10.162, 10.162, 10.162, 10.162, 10.162, 10.162, 10.55, 10.55, 10.55, 10.55, 10.55, 11.075, 11.213, 11.213, 11.213, 11.213, 11.5, 11.5, 11.5, 11.5, 11.5, 11.5, 11.5, 11.887, 11.887, 11.887, 11.887, 11.887, 11.887, 11.887, 11.887, 11.887, 12.375, 12.438, 12.438, 12.438, 12.438, 12.438, 12.438, 12.438, 12.438, 1